# Fallback PAM stack for rdpgw-auth.
#
# AuthProtocols.Basic generates and overwrites this file at startup with the
# configured backend stack. When Basic is disabled (NTLM/Kerberos-only
# deployments) this file must still be valid, so deny explicitly instead of
# including distribution files that the minimal image does not ship.
auth required pam_deny.so
account required pam_deny.so
